A drop of a field the target requires. The backward lens of a rename, with
the derived entry overridden by a drop, leaves 0.0 without its field.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
schema: {
	before: string
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
schema: {
	after: string
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		after: v0_0.before
	}
}

BackwardLens: {
	v1_0: _
	v0_0: {
		after: drop
	}
}
-- out/error --
BackwardLens produces nothing for before, which 0.0 requires: add before: <mapping> to v0_0:
    1.0.thema:12:1
